  "comments": [
    {
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "comment": "B. fragilis strains were grown anaerobically in basal medium (PMID: 2037368) or on brain heart infusion (BHI) agar plates supplemented with 50 μg of hemin and 0.5 μg of menadione (BHIS) per ml."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "comment": "The basal medium was a modification of the medium previously described (18) and contained 5 g of yeast extract, 20 g of proteose peptone, 5 g of NaCl, 60 g of glucose, 5 mg of hemin, and 0.5 mg of vitamin Kl per liter. B. fragilis NCTC 9343 was grown by batch culture in a 20-liter fermenter (Biolafitte, Poissy, France) containing 16 liters of basal medium at 37°C for 18 h."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "comment": "Anaerobiosis was maintained by flushing with N2, and a pH of 7.2 was maintained by titration with 10 N NaOH."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "comment": ""
    }
  ]
}